        "id": 1000127
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T19:02:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As per the implementation ONLY alarms which have ENABLE configured are pushed to eventbus and then kafka form there.\nAbsence of any configuration OR SUPPRESS configuration for any alarm means the alarm is suppressed. \nI dont think there is need to remove an Alarm from config to disable it. If there is a need to disable a configured alarm, push a SUPPRESS config for that alarm.",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_275fa474",
      "revId": "5c6d30374e07f62dfc63a9921a5623c87bc45da2",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
