      "writtenOn": "2017-03-24T19:22:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So your alarm list is a static list?   If a device gets upgraded with a new set of alarms then the adapter will need to be upgraded (hence voltha) to register this alarm?\n\nThe above logic of updating only 1 alarm does not work as it will overwrite the other 999 alarms in the config.  The code in device_agent just take whatever comes from the API and overwrite the existing data.",
      "parentUuid": "ba092121_27ed648c",
